  "title": "Grilled Vegetables with Homemade Teriyaki Sauce",
  "description": "Vegetables get a teriyaki makeover and a deep, smoky flavor from grilling them with a soy sauce-based mixture in this easy side dish recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
